     <P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">绍兴一中学子有多牛？</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">从这里，先后走出了</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>19</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">位中外院士、</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">位北大校长（蔡元培与蒋梦麟）。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">从这里，无数学子实现人生关键</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">起跳</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">：高考和高校自主招生、三位一体招生成绩全省领先，近年来有</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>50</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">余人进入浙江省文、理科前</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>100</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">名，有</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>140</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">多人进入清华、北大，高考一本上线人数每年稳定在</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>600</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">人以上。学科竞赛</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">百花齐放</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">，累计</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>61</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">人获得国际奖牌，其中</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>7</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">人获得国际金牌，获金牌人数居浙江省普高第二位。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 22.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">绍兴一中，不仅是中国，也是国际名校的</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">摇篮</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">，每年都有学生考入英美澳等地的著名学校，其中不乏加州大学伯克利分校、剑桥大学、斯坦福大学、多伦多大学等世界名校。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">但如果你仅仅以为绍兴一中学子会读书、成绩好，那你就错了，融入骨子里的渊博雅正、气度不凡，才是绍兴一中学子最深刻的特质。绍兴一中校长朱雯说，践行</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">求真视野下走向</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>‘</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">博雅</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>’</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">的生本教育</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">，帮助每一个个体焕发各自的精彩，是绍兴一中最想送给孩子们的礼物。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">人才辈出</SPAN></B></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">照亮一中灿烂星空</SPAN></B></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>1897</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，绍兴乡绅、清末著名藏书家徐树兰创办绍郡中西学堂，也就是今天绍兴一中的前身。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>120</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年风云岁月，绍兴一中一直熠熠生辉，一位位大师在这里耕耘，从这里走出，照亮绍兴一中历史的灿烂星空。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">蔡元培、鲁迅、杜亚泉、刘大白、斯霞</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>……</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">一位位名动天下的教育名家曾先后来到绍兴一中从事教育实践，为绍兴一中领古越教育改革之先奠定了坚实的基础。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">著名教育家、文学家夏丏尊，中国公共卫生事业的先驱金宝善，著名历史地理学家陈桥驿</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>……</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">绍兴一中培养的杰出人才横贯各个领域。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">陈建功、潘家铮、许绍燮、徐承恩、沈家骢、陈洪铎</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>……</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">共有</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>19</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">位中外院士从这里走出。绍兴一中拥有院士人数之多，国内中学无出其右者。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，年仅</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>44</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">岁的叶军当选为美国国家科学院院士，为</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">绍兴一中</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">系院士名单又添上了浓墨重彩的一笔。从</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>1979</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年到</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>1985</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，叶军在绍兴一中读完了初、高中。因为研制出了世界上最精准的原子钟，叶军被国际同行公认为光学领域的伟大人物之一，成为</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年度诺贝尔物理学奖的热门候选人。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>2015</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年，叶军回到母校绍兴一中，在给学弟学妹们的演讲中，他说：世界很大，道路很远。但光在，时间才在，希望也在。我们每个人要为自己的人生寻找一束光，或者让自己就成为那束光。这样，大家才能在无涯的时间、无尽的宇宙中看到自己，我们也才能在对光的追求中青春永驻。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">像叶军一样，为了</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">给自己的人生寻找一束光</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">，一代代绍兴一中学子汲着母校的雨露，循着学长们的足迹，书写着自己的人生辉煌，不断为绍兴一中的灿烂星空增添新的光芒。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltag1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">唐文斌，</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>2006</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">年从绍兴一中考入清华大学计算机系，如今是最年轻的</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">百度之星</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">，全球最精准人脸识别技术的创始人，也是和刘强东、王小川等共同登上过</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">中国</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>40</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">位</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>40</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">岁以下的商界精英</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang