" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">的全方位管理体系。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">　　</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">住宿交通：</SPAN></B></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">新一中建有三幢共</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>374</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">间设施先进、设备一流的学生公寓。每间住</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>6</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">人，可容纳</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>2100</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">名学生入住。每间公寓每人</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">张写字台与</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">个储物柜，还有独立阳台、空调、淋浴房（有太阳能热水器）、卫生间、洗漱台等。除此之外，每个楼层有</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">个公共卫生间和洗漱台。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">新一中位于群贤中路与站前大道交叉口东南面，紧邻高铁北站，居三区之中心，区域优势明显，交通十分便捷。学校东接上虞（</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>25</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">分钟车程），西连柯桥（</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>5</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">分钟车程），南达越城（</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>15</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">分钟车程）。目前，公交</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>15</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">路、</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>16</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">路、</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>68</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">路及快速公交</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>BRT</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">均经过学校，地铁一号线群贤路站也在学校附近。对面的元培学院东边大型换乘中心即将建设，至三区的交通将更加便捷。此外，学校还将与公交公司合作，根据学生的实际需求开设各条学生专线。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
